  "releaseNotes": "Code generated for .NET Core (Olive) projects requires Olive.Entities 10.3.0 and Olive.Entities.Data 10.5.0 or later: string-key associations use StringCachedReference, database-paged list modules Include() the associations their columns show, and the new CacheAllRecords() setting and InstanceAccessors((Id, Value)) overloads use [CacheAllRecords] and Database.FindById. An instance accessor that declares its ID now holds its record in a cached reference, which the database cache invalidates, rather than in a static field. Reference both packages directly before regenerating.",
